{"id":"freundschaft","lemma":"Freundschaft","pos":"noun","rank":1559,"glosses":["friendship","relations, relatives"],"ipa":"/ˈfʁɔɪ̯ntʃaft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cd/De-Freundschaft.ogg/De-Freundschaft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Freundschaft","plural":"Freundschaften"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich schätze unsere Freundschaft.","en":"I value our friendship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755828","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to estimate","l":"schätzen"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null]},{"text":"Hast du schon neue Freundschaften geschlossen?","en":"Have you made any new friends yet?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},null,{"g":"shut"}]},{"text":"Deine Freundschaft bedeutet mir viel.","en":"Your friendship means a lot to me.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to imply","l":"bedeuten"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"much, a lot"}]},{"text":"Deine Freundschaft ist wichtig für mich.","en":"Your friendship is important to me.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte mehr als Freundschaft.","en":"I'd like to be more than just friends.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null]}]}